{"title":"這段時間在各區間的時數","description":"選定期間在各區間的移動時間（h:mm）與佔比。\n怎麼看：每根長條一個區間，區間越高顏色越深（心率紅色系、功率橘色系）；上方三段條 = 3 區摘要（心率 < AeT／AeT–LTHR／≥ LTHR；功率 < 80%／80–95%／≥ 95% CP）。期間、區間模型、運動可以換，選擇會記住。\n看什麼：低強度至少 75%，基礎期 ≥ 90%；減量期高強度要保留。\n方法：每次活動用當天有效的門檻切區間（圖下方列出）；只算移動時間（> 1.6 km/h，同 WKO5），手錶推估的功率不算。Seiler 2006、Seiler & Tønnessen 2009、Uphill Athlete、Bosquet 2007；高強度 < 1% 算「沒有」是推估。","kind":"periodzones","zone_kind":"power","model":{"id":"palladino","title":"Palladino 10 區（% CP）","source":"Palladino Power Project zone table (2017/2019)","estimate":false},"models":{"hr":[{"id":"frielhr","title":"Friel 7 區（% LTHR）","estimate":false},{"id":"classichr","title":"WKO5 Classic 5 區（% LTHR）","estimate":false},{"id":"seiler3","title":"Seiler 3 區（AeT／LTHR）","estimate":false}],"power":[{"id":"palladino","title":"Palladino 10 區（% CP）","estimate":false},{"id":"palladino3","title":"3 區（Palladino 80／95% CP）","estimate":false}]},"default_model":{"hr":"frielhr","power":"palladino"},"sports":["road","hike"],"sport_choices":[{"id":"road","label":"路跑"},{"id":"trail","label":"越野跑"},{"id":"hike","label":"登山健行"}],"summary_model":{"id":"palladino3","title":"3 區（Palladino 80／95% CP）"},"view":"total","period":{"key":"lastweek","label":"上週","begin":"2026-09-21","end":"2026-09-27","days":7,"note":null,"phase":{"kind":"specific","label":"專項期","start":"2026-09-05","end":"2026-10-16"}},"period_choices":[{"id":"range","label":"日期範圍"},{"id":"week","label":"本週"},{"id":"lastweek","label":"上週"},{"id":"4w","label":"近 4 週"},{"id":"phase","label":"本期"},{"id":"custom","label":"自訂"}],"rows":[{"id":"1A","name":"Post-interval recovery","pct":"< 65% CP","range":"< 169 W","seconds":4777.0,"share":0.25331424329197155},{"id":"1B","name":"EZ warm-up","pct":"65–75% CP","range":"169–195 W","seconds":9000.0,"share":0.4772510340439071},{"id":"1C","name":"EZ aerobic","pct":"75–80% CP","range":"195–208 W","seconds":2419.0,"share":0.12827447237246792},{"id":"2","name":"Endurance / long run","pct":"80–88% CP","range":"208–229 W","seconds":12